e her own  money so she's really just hustling as  she's working at pops she's trying to  prove that she's not really just your  regular spoiled rich girl but she's not  only proving that to herself  she's also proving that to everyone  guess Veronica will make everyone do the  Hustle challenge in season three  jugheads mom and sister  we know that jugheads family is pretty  messed up but get ready because we're  about to see that interaction on screen  according to the creator of the show  will actually see jugheads mom and  sister jelly bean and justice Jughead  managed to somehow fix his relationship  with his father we feel like his family  won't bring any good news the Jughead  family duo will appear halfway through  season 3 around Episode eight or nine so  stay tuned  who knows maybe his mom and his sister  won't be as bad as they seem  we'll definitely be bringing our popcorn  though hermione has a new power of  course not a magical power  but as the new Riverdale mayor hermione  is enjoying being seen as the powerful  character of the town she'll be able to  make a lot of decisions and according to  Marisol Nichols she's going to use that  power to change her marriage we all know  Hyrum was arrested for fraud and  embezzlement  so perhaps her Maya knew might get some  revenge we can't wait to see potential  power trippy moves from Hermione in her  new role and we have a feeling a few  characters might be in a lot of trouble  because of it House and poly are in a  cult one of perhaps the most interesting  potential storylines of season 3 is what  happens to Alice and Polly their  relationship went through a lot of  turmoil as many mother/daughter  relationships would remember Polly  sipping her tea in season 2 finale when  Alice agreed to a friend's from the farm  coming over to invite him to come visit  and talk to you that sounds nice Polly  well it looks like the farm is a lot  more than just a farm because Alice and  Polly are caught in a weird cult-like